{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_48_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_48","textTraditional":"一、十有九年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_48_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_48","textTraditional":"二、夏四月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_48_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_48","textTraditional":"三、秋，公子結媵陳人之婦于鄄，遂及齊侯、宋公盟。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_48_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_48","textTraditional":"媵者何？諸侯娶一國，則貳國往媵之，以姪娣從。姪者何？兄之子也。娣者何？女弟也。諸侯壹聘九女，諸侯不再娶。媵不書，此何以書？為其有遂事書。大夫無遂事，此其言遂何？聘禮，大夫受命不受辭，出竟有可以安社稷利國家者，則專之可也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_48_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_48","textTraditional":"四、夫人姜氏如莒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_48_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_48","textTraditional":"五、冬，齊人、宋人、陳人伐我西鄙。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}